ino account and start using the tools you've been granted.\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 40px 0 40px;\">\n                <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:separate;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td\n                            align=\"center\"\n                            bgcolor=\"#1c1917\"\n                            style=\"border-radius:8px;\"\n                        >\n                            <a\n                                href=\"https://x.test/api/auth/confirm?token_hash=abc&amp;type=signup\"\n                                target=\"_blank\"\n                                style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\"\n                            >Confirm email address</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:28px 40px 0 40px;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#78716c;\">\n                    Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:\n                </p>\n                <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://x.test/api/auth/confirm?token_hash=abc&amp;type=signup\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1c1917;\">https://x.test/api/auth/confirm?token_hash=abc&amp;type=signup</a>\n                </p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:28px 40px 0 40px;\">\n                <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#78716c;\">\n                    Didn't sign up for Forino? You can safely ignore this email — no account\n                    will be activated.\n            